  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your spiked chain is a tornado of tangling steel.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Cornugon Trip<sup>CED</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you succeed on a trip combat maneuver with your spiked chain, you can attempt a reposition or dirty trick combat maneuver (the latter entangling the target if successful) that does not provoke attacks of opportunity against the same target. Alternatively, when you throw your spiked chain, you can attempt a combat maneuver check to trip two adjacent targets.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc52\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
